{"step_index":142,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-23T16:24:23Z","model":"gemini-3.8-flash-high","input_tokens":2125,"cache_read_tokens":67344,"output_tokens":1710,"thinking":"The chess logic now functions as expected. Considering potential audio enhancements, specifically sound effects for moves, captures, and checks to enrich the user experience. A Web Audio API synthesizer appears suitable, offering offline functionality, zero latency, and diverse sound possibilities.\n\n\nConsidering a structured project layout in TypeScript. The intention is to establish a modular approach with separate modules for types, the chess engine (Stockfish integration), audio (sound effects), React hooks for game logic and AI, and visual React components. This organization should maintain a clean and scalable codebase.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"update_focus","args":{"focus":"Defining TypeScript types for chess game and Stockfish engine"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import { Square, PieceSymbol, Color } from 'chess.js';\n\nexport type GameDifficulty = 'beginner' | 'easy' | 'medium' | 'hard' | 'expert' | 'custom';\n\nexport interface DifficultyConfig {\n  name: string;\n  depth: number;\n  skillLevel: number; // UCI Skill Level: 0 to 20\n  moveTime?: number; // max thinking time in ms\n  description: string;\n}\n\nexport const DIFFICULTY_PRESETS: Record<Exclude<GameDifficulty, 'custom'>, DifficultyConfig> = {\n  beginner: {\n    name: 'Beginner',\n    depth: 3,\n    skillLevel: 2,\n    moveTime: 600,\n    description: 'Fast, casual moves with occasional tactical slips. Great for warm-ups.',\n  },\n  easy: {\n    name: 'Easy',\n    depth: 6,\n    skillLevel: 7,\n    moveTime: 1000,\n    description: 'Moderate depth. Plays solid opening principles with occasional blunders.',\n  },\n  medium: {\n    name: 'Medium',\n    depth: 10,\n    skillLevel: 13,\n    moveTime: 1500,\n    description: 'Strong club-level player. Capitalizes on tactical mistakes.',\n  },\n  hard: {\n    name: 'Hard',\n    depth: 14,\n    skillLevel: 18,\n    moveTime: 2200,\n    description: 'Candidate Master strength. Sharp tactical precision and deep calculations.',\n  },\n  expert: {\n    name: 'Expert',\n    depth: 18,\n    skillLevel: 20,\n    moveTime: 3500,\n    description: 'Stockfish at full skill level. Maximum depth and grandmaster positional play.',\n  },\n};\n\nexport interface MoveRecord {\n  san: string;\n  from: Square;\n  to: Square;\n  piece: PieceSymbol;\n  color: Color;\n  captured?: PieceSymbol;\n  promotion?: PieceSymbol;\n  fenAfter: string;\n  moveNumber: number;\n}\n\nexport interface EngineEvaluation {\n  depth: number;\n  seldepth?: number;\n  scoreCp?: number; // Centipawns from engine's perspective\n  scoreMate?: number; // Moves to mate\n  nodes?: number;\n  nps?: number; // Nodes per second\n  timeMs?: number;\n  pv?: string; // Principal variation (best line)\n  bestMove?: string;\n  ponder?: string;\n}\n\nexport interface EngineStatus {\n  isReady: boolean;\n  isThinking: boolean;\n  isError: boolean;\n  errorMessage?: string;\n  evalInfo: EngineEvaluation | null;\n}\n\nexport interface PlayerInfo {\n  name: string;\n  title?: string;\n  isAi: boolean;\n  color: Color;\n  avatarUrl?: string;\n}\n\nexport type GameStatus = \n  | 'in_progress'\n  | 'check'\n  | 'checkmate'\n  | 'stalemate'\n  | 'insufficient_material'\n  | 'threefold_repetition'\n  | 'fifty_moves'\n  | 'timeout'\n  | 'resigned';\n","Path":"C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\stockfish-chess-arena\\src\\types\\chess.ts"}}]}
