{"step_index":149,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-23T16:25:09Z","model":"gemini-3.8-flash-high","input_tokens":3604,"cache_read_tokens":71007,"output_tokens":2582,"thinking":"Building the Stockfish Web Worker manager requires creating a service to handle Stockfish WASM engine loading and UCI command initialization. The engine will be initialized with the `uci`, `isready`, and `ucinewgame` commands. Next, a FEN position will be set, the search depth specified with a `go depth` command, and engine responses will be stopped with `stop`. The system will then need to parse the `bestmove` response, convert it into a valid chess.js move, and update the chessboard.\n\n\nStockfish service requires careful management of the web worker lifecycle and communication to avoid blocking the user interface. Worker creation is straightforward in the Vite environment, loading the WASM engine from the public directory. Event listeners will handle status updates (ready, thinking, error), evaluation updates (depth, nodes, score), and best move results. New game initialization, difficulty settings, and move requests utilize a `send` function to communicate with the worker using appropriate UCI commands and implement a timeout watchdog to prevent hangs.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import { DifficultyConfig, EngineEvaluation, EngineStatus } from '../types/chess';\nimport { UciAdapter } from './uciAdapter';\n\nexport type EvalCallback = (evaluation: EngineEvaluation) => void;\nexport type BestMoveCallback = (bestMove: string, ponder?: string) => void;\nexport type StatusCallback = (status: EngineStatus) => void;\n\nexport class StockfishService {\n  private worker: Worker | null = null;\n  private isReady: boolean = false;\n  private isThinking: boolean = false;\n  private isError: boolean = false;\n  private errorMessage?: string;\n  private currentEval: EngineEvaluation | null = null;\n\n  private onEvalCallbacks: Set<EvalCallback> = new Set();\n  private onStatusCallbacks: Set<StatusCallback> = new Set();\n  private pendingMoveResolve: ((bestMove: string) => void) | null = null;\n  private pendingMoveReject: ((err: Error) => void) | null = null;\n  private watchdogTimer: number | null = null;\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.initWorker();\n  }\n\n  private notifyStatus() {\n    const status: EngineStatus = {\n      isReady: this.isReady,\n      isThinking: this.isThinking,\n      isError: this.isError,\n      errorMessage: this.errorMessage,\n      evalInfo: this.currentEval,\n    };\n    this.onStatusCallbacks.forEach(cb => cb(status));\n  }\n\n  public onStatus(cb: StatusCallback): () => void {\n    this.onStatusCallbacks.add(cb);\n    this.notifyStatus();\n    return () => this.onStatusCallbacks.delete(cb);\n  }\n\n  public onEval(cb: EvalCallback): () => void {\n    this.onEvalCallbacks.add(cb);\n    return () => this.onEvalCallbacks.delete(cb);\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Initializes or recreates the Stockfish Web Worker\n   */\n  public initWorker() {\n    this.terminate();\n\n    try {\n      this.isReady = false;\n      this.isThinking = false;\n      this.isError = false;\n      this.errorMessage = undefined;\n      this.currentEval = null;\n\n      // In Vite with publicDir, /stockfish.js is served statically\n      this.worker = new Worker('/stockfish.js');\n\n      this.worker.onmessage = (event: MessageEvent) => {\n        const line = typeof event.data === 'string' ? event.data : '';\n        this.handleEngineOutput(line);\n      };\n\n      this.worker.onerror = (err: ErrorEvent) => {\n        console.error('Stockfish Worker Error:', err);\n        this.isError = true;\n        this.errorMessage = err.message || 'Stockfish Web Worker crashed or failed to load.';\n        this.isThinking = false;\n        this.notifyStatus();\n\n        if (this.pendingMoveReject) {\n          this.pendingMoveReject(new Error(this.errorMessage));\n          this.pendingMoveReject = null;\n          this.pendingMoveResolve = null;\n        }\n      };\n\n      // Bootstrap UCI protocol\n      this.send('uci');\n      this.send('isready');\n      this.notifyStatus();\n    } catch (err) {\n      console.error('Failed to construct Stockfish Worker:', err);\n      this.isError = true;\n      this.errorMessage = 'Unable to launch Stockfish Web Worker: ' + String(err);\n      this.notifyStatus();\n    }\n  }\n\n  private send(cmd: string) {\n    if (!this.worker) return;\n    this.worker.postMessage(cmd);\n  }\n\n  private handleEngineOutput(line: string) {\n    if (!line) return;\n\n    const parsed = UciAdapter.parse(line);\n\n    if (parsed.type === 'uciok') {\n      this.send('isready');\n    } else if (parsed.type === 'readyok') {\n      this.isReady = true;\n      this.notifyStatus();\n    } else if (parsed.type === 'info' && parsed.evalInfo) {\n      this.currentEval = {\n        ...this.currentEval,\n        ...parsed.evalInfo,\n      };\n      this.onEvalCallbacks.forEach(cb => cb(this.currentEval!));\n      this.notifyStatus();\n    } else if (parsed.type === 'bestmove') {\n      this.clearWatchdog();\n      this.isThinking = false;\n\n      if (parsed.bestMove) {\n        if (this.currentEval) {\n          this.currentEval.bestMove = parsed.bestMove;\n          this.currentEval.ponder = parsed.ponder;\n        }\n      }\n\n      this.notifyStatus();\n\n      if (this.pendingMoveResolve) {\n        const resolve = this.pendingMoveResolve;\n        this.pendingMoveResolve = null;\n        this.pendingMoveReject = null;\n        resolve(parsed.bestMove || '');\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Applies difficulty options (Skill Level: 0 to 20)\n   */\n  public setDifficulty(config: DifficultyConfig) {\n    if (!this.worker) return;\n    this.send(`setoption name Skill Level value ${Math.min(20, Math.max(0, config.skillLevel))}`);\n    this.send('isready');\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Resets engine state for a fresh game\n   */\n  public newGame() {\n    this.stop();\n    this.send('ucinewgame');\n    this.send('isready');\n    this.currentEval = null;\n    this.notifyStatus();\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Stops active search calculation\n   */\n  public stop() {\n    this.clearWatchdog();\n    if (this.isThinking) {\n      this.send('stop');\n      this.isThinking = false;\n      this.notifyStatus();\n    }\n  }\n\n  private clearWatchdog() {\n    if (this.watchdogTimer !== null) {\n      clearTimeout(this.watchdogTimer);\n      this.watchdogTimer = null;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Asks Stockfish to calculate the best move for given FEN position.\n   * Returns a promise that resolves with the UCI move (e.g. 'e7e5').\n   */\n  public calculateBestMove(fen: string, config: DifficultyConfig): Promise<string> {\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n      if (!this.worker) {\n        this.initWorker();\n      }\n\n      // If already thinking, abort previous calculation\n      if (this.isThinking) {\n        this.stop();\n      }\n\n      this.isThinking = true;\n      this.currentEval = null;\n      this.pendingMoveResolve = resolve;\n      this.pendingM